-- ============================================================
-- Marksmanship: Improved Barrage
-- ============================================================
--
-- TODO.md: "Replace Volley pushback reduction with mana cost reduction of
--  10/20/30%.  (3 ranks)"
--
-- Pure DBC, two columns on each of three ranks.  Effect2 stays an
-- ADD_PCT_MODIFIER and keeps its class mask (EffectSpellClassMaskB1 = 8192,
-- Volley); only the operation changes, MiscValue 9
-- (SPELLMOD_NOT_LOSE_CASTING_TIME) -> 14 (SPELLMOD_COST), and the amount
-- becomes negative because a cost modifier reduces rather than adds.
--
-- Base points are -11/-21/-31 rather than -10/-20/-30: $s2 renders the
-- MAGNITUDE of BasePoints + 1, so -11 prints as 10.
--
-- Effect1 (crit chance for Multi-Shot and Aimed Shot, MiscValue 7) is
-- untouched, as is the prerequisite on Barrage rank 2 (talent 1347).
--
-- Worth stating plainly: the effect being replaced was already dead value.
-- Alonecraft removed casting pushback from damage entirely as a project-level
-- change, so "reduces pushback while channelling Volley" had been doing nothing
-- for anyone since that landed.
--
-- This stacks with Concussive Barrage's -100% on the same Volley, and the
-- combination is safe in either order: Player::ApplySpellMod stops applying
-- cost mods once the running total is <= 0 (Player.cpp:9858) and
-- SpellInfo::CalcPowerCost clamps the result at 0 (SpellInfo.cpp:2886).



